    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Requiem of Reuinis&quot; is a magictower-style RPG where players take on the role of Tassia and her companions, gradually uncovering the truth of a lost history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zonal Exploration: Players can collect resources in different areas and retreat at any time, without worrying about getting stuck due to operational mistakes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy and Research: Players can obtain advanced resources through alchemy using exploration materials, or conduct various research to gradually enhance their strength.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Customization: Nearly 300 equipment pieces and 100 skills, with numerous playable builds, allowing players to create their unique completion strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-layered Narrative: The stories of the protagonist group, knight orders, and the church intertwine to reveal the truth of the\u3010Calamity\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Controls:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game supports mouse play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD/Arrow Keys: Movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spacebar: Trigger event/Confirm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc: Cancel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backspace: Undo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z/X/C/V: Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alt: Outlook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ctrl: Skip dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift: Run</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Requiem of Reuinis&quot; is a magictower-style RPG where players take on the role of Tassia and her companions, gradually uncovering the truth of a lost history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zonal Exploration: Players can collect resources in different areas and retreat at any time, without worrying about getting stuck due to operational mistakes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy and Research: Players can obtain advanced resources through alchemy using exploration materials, or conduct various research to gradually enhance their strength.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Customization: Nearly 300 equipment pieces and 100 skills, with numerous playable builds, allowing players to create their unique completion strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-layered Narrative: The stories of the protagonist group, knight orders, and the church intertwine to reveal the truth of the\u3010Calamity\u3011</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Controls:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game supports mouse play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD/Arrow Keys: Movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spacebar: Trigger event/Confirm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc: Cancel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backspace: Undo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z/X/C/V: Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alt: Outlook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ctrl: Skip dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift: Run</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In &quot;Requiem of Reuinis&quot;, you'll explore lost ruins, cleverly choose equipment and skills, collect resources to enhance yourself through alchemy and research, and strategically defeat various enemies. As you get deeper, you'll gradually uncover the truth of the&quot;Calamity&quot;.",
